






@(1 = 1-4) He has sprouted, he has burgeoned, he is well-watered lettuce, my shaded garden of the desert, richly flourishing,  @varh[t40805.v1]{his mother's favourite } @vart[t40805.v2,t40805.v1]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} he is well-watered lettuce }; my grain lovely in beauty in its furrows, he is well-watered lettuce; my first-class fruitful apple tree, he is well-watered lettuce.

